To simplify $\sqrt{242}$, look for the largest perfect square factor of 242:
$$
\begin{align*}
\sqrt{242} &= \sqrt{121 \times 2} \\
&= \sqrt{121} \times \sqrt{2} \\
&= 11\sqrt{2}
\end{align*}
$$

Thus, $\sqrt{242} = 11\sqrt{2}$.

